# Every text file is checked out with LF, Windows included. The records are
# verified by checksum against the bytes they were made from, the tour and the
# agent project are hashed and quoted by line, and the generators split on
# "\n": a Windows clone with core.autocrlf gave all of them CRLF and the build
# refused bytes the repository does not have.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.wasm binary
*.woff2 binary
